                        "sense_id": "008f39cf-8a44-3ebe-acd4-891209176750",
                        "entry_id": "5a886b4b-3cf5-3811-9615-b320b619a5a9",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Mécréant, personne anticléricale."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "obsolete"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9698a877-db87-4911-bfc0-2d07949ca82c",
                                "sense_id": "008f39cf-8a44-3ebe-acd4-891209176750",
                                "text": "Toute ma jeunesse, j’ai entendu ma grand-mère reprocher à certaines personnes, surtout des hommes, d’être « des vrais chiniquys ». … J’ai compris plus tard qu’elle désignait ainsi un mécréant du genre de mon père, qui ne fréquentait pas l’église et diabolisait le clergé."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d56c917f-76df-405f-9825-19fd3c103d18",
                        "source_entry_id": "5a886b4b-3cf5-3811-9615-b320b619a5a9",
                        "source_sense_id": "008f39cf-8a44-3ebe-acd4-891209176750",
                        "target_lang_word": "miscreant",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "miscreant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecd165b4-e777-380d-8f6a-dbee5f2731b6",
                                        "entry_id": "e8ee7ec0-6daa-3a9a-88ff-1d75fec1d8ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lacking in conscience or moral principles; unscrupulous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9851eacf-25e0-4bc1-8f6e-acdf42c9ff4d",
                                                "sense_id": "ecd165b4-e777-380d-8f6a-dbee5f2731b6",
                                                "text": "How do we get fair treatment when confronting miscreant workers sometimes means no care at all?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec46c951-44cd-3cb9-b76f-845defcdfc3d",
                                        "entry_id": "e8ee7ec0-6daa-3a9a-88ff-1d75fec1d8ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Holding an incorrect religious belief."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "miscreant",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4966d2e0-3274-3d3f-8c89-df1ec12996ee",
                                        "entry_id": "1edfaaf4-4843-37ee-b365-e0ce1a9730f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who has behaved badly, or illegally."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "caec7cef-6fdf-4c13-aa29-12ead3f85c83",
                                                "sense_id": "4966d2e0-3274-3d3f-8c89-df1ec12996ee",
                                                "text": "The teacher sent the miscreants to see the school principal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "031863b2-5c8c-44ca-b159-4ce4e0623b8c",
                                                "sense_id": "4966d2e0-3274-3d3f-8c89-df1ec12996ee",
                                                "text": "Thou art a Traitor, and a Miſcreant;\nToo good to be ſo, and too bad to liue,\nSince the more faire and chriſtall is the skie,\nThe vglier ſeeme the cloudes that in it flye:"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f69bb790-6e75-3a6d-896f-00e52b317664",
                                        "entry_id": "1edfaaf4-4843-37ee-b365-e0ce1a9730f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One not restrained by moral principles; an unscrupulous villain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bca33e10-f52c-4580-91ac-8c5114b70d8d",
                                                "sense_id": "f69bb790-6e75-3a6d-896f-00e52b317664",
                                                "text": "A meagre Catchpole hurries me to fail; No Miscreant, so remorseless, ever tore\nThy Journals, Fog, or knock'd at Franklin's door"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fdc5b55f-170e-3a68-85a1-84a1a71d72c9",
                                        "entry_id": "1edfaaf4-4843-37ee-b365-e0ce1a9730f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who holds a false religious belief; a misbeliever."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77dea20b-80a4-4af1-8b60-be91836d7ae0",
                                                "sense_id": "fdc5b55f-170e-3a68-85a1-84a1a71d72c9",
                                                "text": "Now wil the Chriſtian miſcreants be glad,\nRinging with ioy their ſuperſtitious belles:\nAnd making bonfires for my ouerthrow.\nBut ere I die thoſe foule Idolaters\nShall make me bonfires with their filthy bones, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6943023e-6c3e-4fc6-b260-02831e122788",
                                                "sense_id": "fdc5b55f-170e-3a68-85a1-84a1a71d72c9",
                                                "text": "Arise thou cursed Miscreaunt,\nThat hast with knightlesse guile and trecherous train\nFaire knighthood fowly shamed"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6230366-ac80-49ca-8036-8e37fbe4d550",
                                                "sense_id": "fdc5b55f-170e-3a68-85a1-84a1a71d72c9",
                                                "text": "Before thine eyes, thou mild and blessed one, said he, half aloud, are these miscreants daring to hold their market, and trafficking in their hellish drugs"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
